sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as order-service
    participant C as ReservationController
    participant S as ReservationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    O->>C: POST /internal/reservations {orderId, lines}
    C->>S: reserve(orderId, lines)
    S->>S: merge lines per SKU, sort by SKU
    S->>DB: BEGIN
    S->>DB: SELECT reservations WHERE order_id = ? FOR UPDATE
    alt already reserved (retry)
        S-->>C: Reserved(expiresAt)
    else new
        loop each SKU in order
            S->>DB: UPDATE stock SET available -= q, reserved += q WHERE available >= q
            alt 0 rows
                S->>DB: ROLLBACK
                S-->>C: OutOfStock(sku)
            end
        end
        S->>DB: INSERT reservations (RESERVED, expires_at = now + 15 min)
        S->>DB: INSERT outbox StockChanged per SKU
        S->>DB: COMMIT
        S-->>C: Reserved(expiresAt)
    end
    C-->>O: 200 RESERVED  or  409 OUT_OF_STOCK problem
